OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry, sunny and very hot day
OL,6,Facross many parts of England and
OL,7,FWales. Humidity levels will also be
OL,8,Fhigh for some. Cloudier across
OL,9,FScotland and Northern Ireland with
OL,10,Fshowers, possibly heavy and thundery
OL,11,Fduring the afternoon and evening.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy with showers continues
OL,14,Facross Northern Ireland and Scotland,
OL,15,Flocally heavy with isolated
OL,16,Fthunderstorms, spreading southeast.
OL,17,FElsewhere, warm overnight with clear
OL,18,Fspells. Low cloud and coastal fog may
OL,19,Fdevelop southwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
