OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FStaying hot across much of
OL,6,FEngland and Wales before a weak cold
OL,7,Ffront brings cooler, cloudier weather
OL,8,Fin from the west. Isolated afternoon
OL,9,Fthunderstorms are possible in the
OL,10,Fsoutheast.
